---

<Layout title="Sprunki音乐角色介绍 - 认识音乐世界的伙伴们" 
        description="探索Sprunki游戏中的音乐角色，包括节奏大师、音效专家和旋律精灵。每个角色都拥有独特的音乐能力和个性。">
  <Container>
    <div class="py-16">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-8"><a href="https://sprunkigames.online">Sprunki音乐角色</a></h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-center text-gray-600 mb-16">
         认识这些可爱的音乐精灵，他们将带你进入美妙的音乐世界！点击角色了解更多！
      </p>

      {/* 节奏部分 */}
      <section class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-8 text-purple-600">节奏大师</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-6">
          {characters.beats.map(character => (
            <a href={character.link} class="block group">
              <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md overflow-hidden flex flex-col transform transition-transform duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1">
                <div class="overflow-hidden">
                  <img 
                    src={character.image} 
                    alt={character.name} 
                    class="w-full h-[360px] object-cover object-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300"
                  />
                </div>
                <div class="p-4 flex-1 flex flex-col">
                  <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2 line-clamp-2 text-gray-800">{character.name}</h3>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 line-clamp-3 flex-1">{character.description}</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* 音效部分 */}
      <section class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-8 text-blue-600">音效大师</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-6">
          {characters.effects.map(character => (
            <a href={character.link} class="block">
              <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg overflow-hidden transform hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300">
                <img src={character.image} alt={character.name} class="w-full object-cover h-[360px]" />
                <div class="p-4">
                  <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">{character.name}</h3>
                  <p class="text-gray-600">{character.description}</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* 旋律部分 */}
      <section class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-8 text-green-600">旋律精灵</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-6">
          {characters.melodies.map(character => (
            <a href={character.link} class="block">
              <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg overflow-hidden transform hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300">
                <img src={character.image} alt={character.name} class="w-full h-[360px] object-cover" />
                <div class="p-4">
                  <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">{character.name}</h3>
                  <p class="text-gray-600">{character.description}</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </Container>
</Layout>

<style>
  .grid {
    --auto-grid-min-size: 240px;
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .grid {
      --auto-grid-min-size: 280px;
    }
  }

  .line-clamp-2 {
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  
  .line-clamp-3 {
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 3;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
</style> 